OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStarting murky for many with
OL,6,Ffog and low cloud lingering well into
OL,7,Fthe day in places. Turning sunnier for
OL,8,Fmost but cloudier and occasionally
OL,9,Fwetter in Scotland and Northern
OL,10,FIreland. Feeling pleasant in the sunny
OL,11,Fintervals and light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FFog patches reforming tonight
OL,14,Ffor England and parts of Wales.
OL,15,FCloudier in the north with outbreaks
OL,16,Fof light rain sinking into northern
OL,17,FEngland and Wales. Showers behind and
OL,18,Ffeeling colder.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
