OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA foggy start for England and
OL,6,FWales, slowly clearing during late
OL,7,Fmorning for most. Cloudier for
OL,8,Fnorthern England and Wales with rain
OL,9,Fpushing southwards. Sunnier for
OL,10,FScotland and Northern Ireland.
